<title>SRI LANKA: Ceylon Tea soars on growth in tea sector.</title>
<headline>Ceylon Tea soars on growth in tea sector.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Ceylon Tea Services Ltd rose 6.67 percent or 10 rupees to 160 rupees in early Friday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is buying due to the euphoria attached to all stocks having anything to do with tea,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Earnings from tea are expected to rise in 1997, on top of good years in 1995 and 1996, due to continuing demand from the Commonwealth of Independent States and the Middle East, brokers said.</p>
<p>Ceylon Tea Services produces and exports value-added teas such as tea bags.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
